OL,3,GNEWSATeddy bear appeal has 'exceeded'
OL,4,Aexpectations
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn appeal for teddy bears to help
OL,7,Fcomfort children entering the care
OL,8,Fsystem has "exceeded" expectations,
OL,9,Forganisers say.
OL,11,FFoster for Plymouth hopes to collect at
OL,12,Fleast 550 brand-new teddy bears and
OL,13,Fsoft toys by the end of November in the
OL,14,Fcity-wide appeal, enough for every
OL,15,Fchild and young person currently looked
OL,16,Fafter by the city council to receive
OL,17,Fone.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
