OL,3,GNEWSATeddy bear appeal has 'exceeded'
OL,4,Aexpectations
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlymouth City Council said it had seen
OL,7,Fan "incredible response" and already
OL,8,Freceived more than 300 bears, with
OL,9,F"lots of organisations running their
OL,10,Fown collections on our behalf, so we're
OL,11,Fhopeful we'll surpass our minimum
OL,12,Fgoal".
OL,14,FIt said: "At the very least, we wanted
OL,15,Fto ensure every child and young person
OL,16,Fcurrently in care could receive a
OL,17,Fbear."
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
